+## 6. Known issues and gotchas
+
+**Flaky test.** `test/auth-enrollment.test.js` ("verified human issues a single-use permissioned agent enrollment") times out under full-suite load. It takes about 7–20 s even on the unchanged base, and it passes alone and on rerun. A task chip exists for it.
+
+**CI image pulls.** CI can fail in about 13 s on "toomanyrequests: Data limit exceeded" from the public registry. That's not code: `gh run rerun <id> --failed`.
+
+**Line endings.** Files check out as CRLF. Python or string patch scripts must normalize `\r\n` before matching.
+
+**Tool quirks**
+- The Bash tool's heredoc parsing sometimes fails on long `cat <<'EOF'`. Use the Write tool for files, then run them.
+- PowerShell's `Remove-Item` on globs was blocked as a "system path"; delete with Node instead.
+
+**Tests run in PowerShell** (not Git Bash). PostgreSQL runs only in CI (`npm run test:postgres`). It includes `a5-presence` and `update-json`.
+
+**Staging container restart.** Since #77, dashboard edits restart the app container within about a minute. Before it, a running container kept its start-time variables.
